  "goodToKnow": "Das Elternhaus is literally one's parents' house, and figuratively one's family background: aus einem guten Elternhaus stammen. Studies like PISA have repeatedly shown that in Germany, school success depends heavily on the Elternhaus: children of academics are far more likely to go to a Gymnasium and university. Initiatives like ArbeiterKind.de support first-generation students. Plural: die Elternhäuser."
